WEBVTT

00:02.753 --> 00:03.879
It lays there.

00:05.923 --> 00:08.175
In the deepest, darkest place.

00:10.093 --> 00:11.512
And so it waits.

00:13.430 --> 00:15.140
For someone to come.

00:28.070 --> 00:30.906
All on its own.

00:35.577 --> 00:37.246
That was a weird dream.

00:40.791 --> 00:43.460
♪ Good Luck lies in odd numbers ♪

00:43.460 --> 00:44.461
♪ Good Luck ♪

00:45.587 --> 00:54.221
(Loner Life in Another World)

00:55.597 --> 00:58.267
♪ Shutting in my room
Makes me invincible on Mondays ♪

00:58.267 --> 01:00.644
♪ A single step outside
And it's trouble all over the place ♪

01:00.644 --> 01:03.313
♪ Someone fires a flare signaling a mayday ♪

01:03.313 --> 01:05.649
♪ I wish I could pretend I didn't hear it ♪

01:05.732 --> 01:08.151
♪ Enough with fair fights ♪

01:08.151 --> 01:10.654
♪ First come first serve is an illusion ♪

01:10.654 --> 01:12.906
♪ Leave everything to the dice ♪

01:12.906 --> 01:15.158
♪ But I'm bad with my rolls ♪

01:15.742 --> 01:18.245
♪ See, it may not be a clean cut ♪

01:18.245 --> 01:20.789
♪ But surprisingly
You're not just some leftover ♪

01:20.789 --> 01:23.250
♪ They have something that I don't?♪

01:23.250 --> 01:26.545
♪ That's nonsense, I won't greed over that ♪

01:27.296 --> 01:30.465
♪ People decide who's a loner
And who is worthless ♪

01:30.465 --> 01:33.135
♪ Hold it right there young boy
You have some free time, right?♪

01:33.135 --> 01:35.178
♪ Don't you just hate crowds?♪

01:35.178 --> 01:38.140
♪ If you're bored, why not try a gamble?♪

01:38.140 --> 01:41.018
♪ Manage the botches and luck then dance ♪

01:41.018 --> 01:43.645
♪ Not really into failing and falling ♪

01:43.645 --> 01:46.148
♪ Good Luck lies in odd numbers ♪

01:46.148 --> 01:49.067
♪ Doesn't cheating count as a skill?♪

01:59.536 --> 02:06.918
♪ Good Luck lies in odd numbers ♪

02:06.918 --> 02:08.003
♪ Good Luck ♪

02:10.000 --> 02:11.048
(Day 26)

02:11.048 --> 02:14.134
(Day 26)
So tired... So sleepy...

02:14.440 --> 02:14.635
(Episode 8 Dungeon Exploration)

02:14.635 --> 02:17.950
(Episode 8 Dungeon Exploration)
I still haven't fully recovered
from the fight with Tanaka...

02:17.950 --> 02:18.388
I still haven't fully recovered
from the fight with Tanaka...

02:21.016 --> 02:23.894
Haruka, good morning.

02:23.894 --> 02:26.605
Oh, morning.

02:27.105 --> 02:30.017
Going off to the dungeon again?

02:30.019 --> 02:33.445
There's been a lot of monsters lately,
so we've been busy.

02:33.945 --> 02:39.344
We've been wanting to get a rare item
from the dungeon, but you know...

02:39.346 --> 02:41.306
Rare item?

02:42.037 --> 02:44.122
What does it do?

02:44.122 --> 02:48.043
They said it can change others'
values and opinions of you.

02:50.128 --> 02:52.631
Well, isn't that perfect
for introverts like you guys?

02:52.631 --> 02:54.758
Hey, that was unnecessary!

02:54.758 --> 02:57.295
The same goes for you, actually.

02:57.297 --> 02:58.970
We're in a hurry, so we'll be off.

02:59.680 --> 03:03.016
They're like a real adventurer
here already.

03:03.016 --> 03:05.310
But as for me...

03:05.310 --> 03:05.352
(Reunited with the Nerds!)

03:05.352 --> 03:07.370
(Reunited with the Nerds!)
I've found the Nerds and defeated Tanaka.

03:07.370 --> 03:08.939
(Took out Tanaka!)
I've found the Nerds and defeated Tanaka.

03:08.939 --> 03:09.410
(Took out Tanaka!)

03:09.754 --> 03:12.590
There's no more reason for me
to be in this town!

03:13.812 --> 03:18.076
That means I can go to my old cave
in the forest and get my loner life back!

03:26.248 --> 03:31.712
Haruka, can we talk for just a moment?

03:31.712 --> 03:34.339
W-what do you want to talk about?

03:34.339 --> 03:38.385
It's not another lecture, right?
You already gave a lot last night.

03:38.385 --> 03:39.845
(Why did you do that?!)
Why did you do that?!

03:39.845 --> 03:41.763
(Where did you go off to?!)
Where did you go off to?!

03:41.763 --> 03:44.015
Don't you know how to report,
inform and consult us?

03:44.015 --> 03:45.392
Tsk tsk tsk.

03:47.015 --> 03:50.897
That's everyone's lecture. I still haven't
done any of my personal lectures.

03:52.899 --> 03:58.884
Haruka, why did you go and do
such a dangerous thing yesterday?

03:58.886 --> 04:00.323
W-well...

04:00.907 --> 04:03.160
No more dangerous deals, okay?

04:04.661 --> 04:07.914
Okay... Sorry...

04:07.916 --> 04:09.541
All right, good.

04:13.222 --> 04:15.176
Tanaka's nothing compared to her...

04:15.681 --> 04:18.300
She's going to make me
have PTSD sooner or later...

04:18.925 --> 04:24.014
If I'm going to have a stable loner life
without angering the Class Rep, then...

04:24.511 --> 04:28.473
They said it can change others'
values and opinions of you.

04:29.102 --> 04:35.192
If I use that item to raise my affinity,
then nobody will ever scold me again!

04:37.152 --> 04:40.322
Time to go to the dungeon!

04:51.666 --> 04:56.046
Father, shouldn't you take some rest?

04:56.087 --> 04:58.590
Believe me, I know.

04:59.174 --> 05:01.718
But Omui here is a frontier town.

05:02.385 --> 05:04.762
With the recent increase
in monster attacks,

05:04.764 --> 05:07.100
the number of merchants
coming here has dwindled.

05:08.016 --> 05:12.229
As the local lord, I have to put in my work,
or the town will never flourish.

05:12.979 --> 05:14.189
But...

05:18.652 --> 05:21.154
You're from the dungeon...

05:21.154 --> 05:22.364
What's going on?

05:23.740 --> 05:27.410
Bad news, Sir!
A flock of monsters is coming!

05:33.208 --> 05:35.910
The dungeon should be this way...

05:35.910 --> 05:35.919
The dungeon should be this way...
(Presence Detection)

05:35.919 --> 05:37.670
(Presence Detection)

05:46.813 --> 05:49.057
Well, time for a warm-up.

05:50.559 --> 05:54.651
This time, we'd like you to hunt
some monsters near the highway.

05:54.653 --> 05:56.071
Understood.

05:57.148 --> 05:59.150
There's an emergency!

05:59.150 --> 06:01.695
Lady Merielle, what's wrong?

06:02.195 --> 06:05.115
If I recall, she's the daughter
of the local lord, yes?

06:07.868 --> 06:12.414
A huge swarm of orcs
is coming to this town!

06:12.416 --> 06:14.916
A nearby village
has already been destroyed!

06:16.877 --> 06:18.670
You heard the lady, everyone!

06:18.670 --> 06:21.254
Get ready to protect the town!

06:21.256 --> 06:22.924
Start the preparations right away!

06:22.926 --> 06:23.925
Everyone...

06:25.468 --> 06:29.637
Mister Guildmaster, we will help as well!

06:29.639 --> 06:31.641
Yeah, we'll be counting on ya.

06:31.643 --> 06:32.392
Understood!

06:34.895 --> 06:37.063
I have to tell everyone at the inn!

06:37.856 --> 06:39.774
Wait, speaking of...

06:40.317 --> 06:42.736
Where is Haruka...?

06:45.989 --> 06:50.535
Never seen so many of them at once.
There's one that looks like an orc king.

07:00.040 --> 07:01.171
Eh, whatever.

07:06.394 --> 07:07.427
Soon...

07:08.067 --> 07:11.139
The vast horde of orcs will come...

07:12.307 --> 07:15.060
Prepare for battle, men!

07:15.060 --> 07:17.479
Yeah!

07:19.060 --> 07:20.730
(Orc King, Lv 37)

07:20.732 --> 07:22.776
If one blow isn't enough...

07:23.485 --> 07:24.861
Then have a ton more!

07:31.910 --> 07:34.579
All right, that takes care of that!

07:36.623 --> 07:39.250
Still, that's quite a lot of them.

07:39.250 --> 07:41.336
Did something cause this?

07:41.336 --> 07:45.173
Oh well. Where was the dungeon again?

07:52.018 --> 07:52.800
That must be it.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.306
(Stealth)
That must be it.

07:53.306 --> 07:54.800
(Stealth)

07:59.437 --> 08:03.692
A historical place where
numerous adventurers have come and gone.

08:05.151 --> 08:10.240
I can feel the nervousness
as I approach the place they have gone to.

08:11.992 --> 08:15.578
A dungeon... This gets my blood pumping.

08:15.578 --> 08:16.830
All right.

08:16.830 --> 08:20.500
So, where's the item
that can raise my affinity?

08:23.628 --> 08:25.797
Sweet, a treasure chest already!

08:27.003 --> 08:28.508
Go, Appraisal!

08:29.259 --> 08:31.886
Hey, they're all junks!

08:33.004 --> 08:34.097
What about that one?!

08:34.097 --> 08:35.571
This one?!

08:35.573 --> 08:36.824
The other one?!

08:38.309 --> 08:40.854
Is there anything other than junk here?

08:40.854 --> 08:43.023
And what about the affinity-raising item?

08:43.023 --> 08:46.234
I should've asked someone
who knows about these things.

08:48.286 --> 08:50.236
Oh, speaking of that.

08:50.238 --> 08:54.492
This shop is full of special items
taken straight from dungeons.

08:54.492 --> 08:57.537
That shady shopkeeper
might know a thing or two.

08:58.496 --> 09:01.041
I'll head back to town and ask him.

09:04.878 --> 09:07.922
Are the orcs actually coming...?

09:07.922 --> 09:11.801
They were pretty close...
Or at least, they were supposed to...

09:11.802 --> 09:12.885
Suppose?

09:12.886 --> 09:15.638
This isn't a false info, right?

09:15.638 --> 09:17.891
I-I can't exactly confirm that...

09:17.891 --> 09:19.642
Something's heading this way!

09:29.619 --> 09:30.737
Haruka?!

09:32.440 --> 09:35.867
What's with the campfire?
Is this a festival?

09:35.867 --> 09:39.370
No! A nearby village
was attacked by monsters!

09:39.996 --> 09:41.956
This town is in danger!

09:42.499 --> 09:45.210
Huh, I see.

09:45.210 --> 09:48.213
We've been standing by
to protect the town!

09:48.213 --> 09:50.507
Where have you been all this time?!

09:50.507 --> 09:53.093
Uh, about that...

09:53.093 --> 09:54.135
Geez.

09:54.135 --> 09:55.345
Good grief.

09:55.345 --> 09:57.514
You always give us trouble.

09:57.514 --> 09:58.681
Really that.

09:58.681 --> 10:00.934
- Then...
- What about the orcs?

10:02.578 --> 10:04.914
Are you guys talking about orcs?

10:04.916 --> 10:06.167
That's true.

10:08.399 --> 10:10.235
Wait, Haruka, don't tell me...

10:11.945 --> 10:14.948
I think I took them all out...

10:16.407 --> 10:17.784
All of them?!

10:17.784 --> 10:20.495
Yeah. What was that all about?

10:20.495 --> 10:23.081
It's like a whack-a-mole with orcs.

10:29.682 --> 10:34.551
Why did you do
such a dangerous thing again?!

10:40.265 --> 10:42.183
As the daughter of the local lord,

10:42.183 --> 10:45.311
I would like to express my gratitude
for protecting the town.

10:46.104 --> 10:47.981
And I, as the guildmaster, as well.

10:49.691 --> 10:52.378
But you shouldn't do
something that dangerous.

10:52.380 --> 10:55.466
One mistake and you
could've died, you know?

10:56.000 --> 10:58.002
That's right, you hear?!

10:59.951 --> 11:04.539
You see, we're lecturing you like this
with a good reason.

11:05.081 --> 11:08.459
Lately, there has been
an increase in monster activity.

11:09.335 --> 11:13.339
Especially the monsters
that went out from dungeons.

11:13.923 --> 11:15.258
Because of this,

11:15.258 --> 11:20.722
we're expecting a monster stampede
to happen soon.

11:20.722 --> 11:23.933
That's why you should stay put, please.

11:24.434 --> 11:26.436
Promise us, Haruka.

11:26.436 --> 11:28.897
O-okay...

11:29.522 --> 11:32.025
It's not just the girls and the Class Rep,

11:32.025 --> 11:37.238
now even the guildmaster and the local
lord's daughter have their eyes on me.

11:37.240 --> 11:42.243
At this rate, my dream of a free
loner life is only getting further...

11:43.245 --> 11:44.725
I knew it, I have to hurry

11:46.623 --> 11:50.168
and find the affinity-raising item!

11:51.000 --> 11:52.670
(Day 27)

11:52.670 --> 11:53.796
(Day 27)
There you are!

11:56.257 --> 11:58.092
Hey, been a while.

11:58.343 --> 12:00.803
P-please, good sir!

12:00.803 --> 12:03.723
I cannot have my wares
get fused again like last time!

12:03.723 --> 12:06.309
I have nothing to sell to you!

12:06.309 --> 12:08.853
I'm not here to buy anything today.

12:09.103 --> 12:09.812
Huh?

12:09.812 --> 12:11.773
I want to ask something.

12:11.773 --> 12:14.901
Do you know about
the affinity-raising item?

12:14.901 --> 12:18.529
Oh? An item that raises your affinity?

12:19.030 --> 12:20.490
If that's the case,

12:20.990 --> 12:26.120
I have heard about the Pheromone Ring
that can be found in a nearby dungeon.

12:27.330 --> 12:31.459
A Pheromone Ring?!
Those Nerds sure know their thing!

12:31.960 --> 12:35.088
So, at which part of the dungeon is it?!

12:35.088 --> 12:38.091
I've searched all over the first floor,
and I found nothing!

12:38.216 --> 12:40.343
But of course.

12:40.969 --> 12:44.555
It's most likely in an area
people haven't explored yet.

12:44.555 --> 12:47.058
Probably somewhere deeper
than the 50th floor.

12:47.294 --> 12:49.129
50th floor, huh?

12:49.580 --> 12:52.146
Speaking of which,
how many floors does it have?

12:52.146 --> 12:55.733
I've heard it goes
as deep as the 100th floor.

12:55.733 --> 12:58.861
But going down will not be easy.

12:59.529 --> 13:00.697
What do you mean?

13:00.697 --> 13:03.366
Each floor has a boss called Floor Master,

13:03.366 --> 13:07.829
and you need to defeat them
to go to the next floor.

13:09.315 --> 13:11.207
Floor Master, huh?

13:11.207 --> 13:18.172
That place is full of mysteries
like the tale of the Dungeon Emperor.

13:18.172 --> 13:22.552
If you're going there, you need to prepare
some things, like recovery potions.

13:23.052 --> 13:24.637
Oh, okay.

13:24.637 --> 13:26.472
I'll go get some from the general store.

13:27.110 --> 13:27.307
(Clunk)

13:27.307 --> 13:28.266
(Clunk)
You're not buying here?

13:28.266 --> 13:28.780
(Clunk)

13:31.385 --> 13:33.104
He's going to the dungeon?

13:33.104 --> 13:37.191
Yes, apparently he's looking for something
called a Pheromone Ring.

13:39.444 --> 13:41.499
That's very worrying...

13:42.196 --> 13:44.365
Not to mention, that ring...

13:45.158 --> 13:47.994
It would raise his affinity
with others, right?

13:48.870 --> 13:52.457
If Haruka gets his hand
on something like that...

13:52.457 --> 13:56.002
Things will definitely get messy!

13:56.961 --> 13:59.213
We have to stop him, no matter what!

13:59.213 --> 14:00.715
No objections!!

14:02.759 --> 14:06.090
Solo dungeon exploration is so fun!

14:06.090 --> 14:06.095
Solo dungeon exploration is so fun!
(Presence Detection)

14:06.095 --> 14:09.590
(Presence Detection)

14:13.269 --> 14:15.605
Wait, why is everyone following me?!

14:17.440 --> 14:19.484
There's nothing solo about this at all.

14:20.318 --> 14:24.280
What's with all the crowd? Today's not
the scheduled grinding day, right?

14:24.781 --> 14:28.493
What about you? What are you
planning to do in the dungeon?

14:30.078 --> 14:34.040
You're not looking for
the Pheromone Ring, aren't you?

14:34.374 --> 14:39.545
O-of course not! What I'm looking for
is... is the Solomon Ring!

14:39.670 --> 14:41.800
(- Where are you going, little birdie?)
It's a rare ring that allows you

14:41.800 --> 14:43.800
(- The forest.)
to talk with animals, you know?

14:43.841 --> 14:46.969
Oh, is that so?

14:50.333 --> 14:51.555
Chase after him!

14:51.557 --> 14:53.601
Hey, hold it!

14:53.601 --> 14:55.770
You're not allowed to enter right now.

14:55.770 --> 14:58.606
We just had monsters
coming out of here yesterday.

14:58.606 --> 15:00.691
Hey, I said you can't go in!

15:03.358 --> 15:07.325
Geez... I'm not taking
any responsibility, okay?!

15:10.827 --> 15:14.872
I can't let them get
the Pheromone Ring before me!

15:17.458 --> 15:20.211
Haruka! It's dangerous to run in here!

15:20.211 --> 15:21.879
There might be traps!

15:21.879 --> 15:26.008
I'll be fine!
My luck stat is capped anyway!

15:33.391 --> 15:34.517
What?!

15:45.278 --> 15:46.654
Haruka!

15:51.576 --> 15:53.953
Haruka!

15:57.099 --> 15:59.293
I've been falling for so long!

15:59.295 --> 16:00.710
Just how deep is this hole?!

16:01.252 --> 16:02.712
At this height...

16:04.464 --> 16:06.716
I would be dead even if I could land on my feet!

16:09.410 --> 16:11.120
It's the floor! In that case...!

16:16.100 --> 16:17.643
Ow...

16:17.643 --> 16:21.481
Thankfully, cushioning myself with
Earth Magic was the right call...

16:21.481 --> 16:26.861
Am I on the bottom floor?
As in, the 100th floor?

16:29.405 --> 16:31.199
A suspicious-looking hallway.

16:31.991 --> 16:35.369
There's probably a final boss
or more traps in there.

16:35.870 --> 16:39.040
Let's just try going back
to the hole using Air Walk.

16:39.417 --> 16:42.355
Come on! Come on!

16:42.357 --> 16:43.461
It's not working...

16:46.631 --> 16:51.010
Air Walk is a walking skill,
so it can't be used to walk vertically.

16:54.597 --> 16:57.517
I guess I have to find another way out.

16:58.939 --> 17:01.567
Wait, I know
what the surroundings are like.

17:03.000 --> 17:03.511
(Spatial Awareness Lv 1, Trap Detection Lv 1)

17:03.511 --> 17:06.317
(Spatial Awareness Lv 1, Trap Detection Lv 1)
I learned Spatial Awareness Lv 1?

17:06.317 --> 17:08.694
(Spatial Awareness Lv 1, Trap Detection Lv 1)
Was it because I was walking
in a hard-to-see place?

17:08.694 --> 17:09.320
(Spatial Awareness Lv 1
Trap Detection Lv 1)

17:09.320 --> 17:12.782
This is great! I can use it for designing
and remodeling!

17:13.587 --> 17:18.162
But the fact that I learned
Trap Detection Lv 1 pisses me off.

17:18.162 --> 17:21.582
Did I learn it because I fell into a trap?

17:22.830 --> 17:24.252
That's way too late!

17:24.794 --> 17:25.962
Oh well.

17:26.087 --> 17:30.049
Let's try Spatial Awareness
and Trap Detection right away.

17:33.177 --> 17:35.638
All right, no trap in the hallway.

17:36.264 --> 17:36.630
I might find a way to return to the surface
if I get to the end of the big room.

17:36.630 --> 17:38.060
(101st floor)
I might find a way to return to the surface
if I get to the end of the big room.

17:38.060 --> 17:40.643
I might find a way to return to the surface
if I get to the end of the big room.

17:42.144 --> 17:43.813
Wait, 101st floor?

17:44.522 --> 17:46.691
So I'm somewhere deeper
than the supposed bottom floor?

17:47.525 --> 17:51.279
Forget the final boss,
I might find a hidden secret boss here...

17:52.405 --> 17:55.740
Class Rep, are you sure
it's okay to keep going?

17:55.742 --> 17:58.160
We didn't bring any food, you know?

17:59.370 --> 18:01.455
We have to find Haruka...

18:04.894 --> 18:06.701
I feel like my lungs are going numb...

18:07.211 --> 18:10.590
The magic miasma here is thicker
than the one back in the forest.

18:18.264 --> 18:20.933
Yeah, there's definitely
something behind that door.

18:20.933 --> 18:23.144
Am I really going to face a secret boss?

18:23.721 --> 18:26.314
Oh well, it's not like
there's any other way.

18:31.527 --> 18:35.114
Just what could possess
such a sinister mana?!

18:38.557 --> 18:39.767
It must be that thing!

18:41.495 --> 18:43.414
If I don't focus, I'll get blown away...

18:44.116 --> 18:47.084
I have to keep moving forward!

18:47.126 --> 18:47.750
Appraisal!

18:47.750 --> 18:48.419
(Appraisal)
Appraisal!

18:48.419 --> 18:49.040
(Appraisal)

18:49.600 --> 18:52.170
(Dungeon Emperor Lv 100)

18:53.087 --> 18:55.009
Level 100?!

18:55.010 --> 18:56.052
(47th floor)

18:56.052 --> 18:58.804
(47th floor)
This is the 47th floor, isn't it?

18:58.804 --> 18:59.120
(47th floor)

18:59.305 --> 19:01.390
He's still nowhere to be found...

19:01.390 --> 19:04.018
Maybe he fell all the way
to the bottom floor?

19:04.018 --> 19:08.898
Hey, that is the teleport gate that can
take you back to the entrance, right?

19:08.898 --> 19:13.611
Yes. They appear once you defeat
the monsters and clear the floor.

19:14.153 --> 19:18.616
Then he can also just use the gate
to go back, right?

19:19.200 --> 19:22.204
He might not have that choice.

19:22.206 --> 19:24.872
I believe he's going upwards
from the bottom floor.

19:25.715 --> 19:29.251
The gate might not appear
if he's not using the proper route.

19:31.379 --> 19:34.340
Then again, knowing him,

19:34.340 --> 19:36.926
he's probably doing fine
despite the situation.

19:37.426 --> 19:39.261
Kakizaki...

19:39.261 --> 19:42.181
Then again, this is
the oldest grand dungeon.

19:43.015 --> 19:44.517
They said at its bottom is...

19:44.998 --> 19:46.503
The Dungeon Emperor?

19:46.505 --> 19:47.186
Yeah.

19:47.190 --> 19:47.978
(Dungeon Boss, Floor Master, Monsters)

19:47.978 --> 19:50.981
(Dungeon Boss, Floor Master, Monsters)
They said even the Dungeon Boss
is a subordinate of the Dungeon Emperor.

19:50.981 --> 19:51.774
(Dungeon Emperor, Dungeon Boss,
Floor Master)

19:51.774 --> 19:55.611
(Dungeon Emperor, Dungeon Boss)
I heard the monsters here are stronger
simply because that Dungeon Emperor exists.

19:55.611 --> 19:56.530
(Dungeon Emperor, Dungeon Boss)

19:56.530 --> 20:01.242
T-that's just a rumor, a legend, right?

20:01.242 --> 20:03.786
But if it's really true...

20:03.786 --> 20:07.957
The monsters we fought here
are already level 40 and higher.

20:08.541 --> 20:11.085
It would be hard to continue on.

20:11.794 --> 20:14.338
We probably should turn back soon.

20:17.758 --> 20:20.261
I know it's pretty scary...

20:20.261 --> 20:23.472
But Haruka saved us all before.

20:23.472 --> 20:27.059
Now it's our turn to save him!

20:27.059 --> 20:29.270
T-that's right!

20:29.623 --> 20:33.418
I guess we should at least try
to go as far as we could.

20:33.956 --> 20:36.435
Yeah, let's go save Haruka!

20:36.437 --> 20:37.153
Gotcha!

20:38.703 --> 20:42.158
Let's go get Haruka,
with all of us together.

20:42.158 --> 20:44.034
Yeah!!

20:53.169 --> 20:55.296
I managed to use Appraisal on it, but...

20:59.506 --> 21:03.350
All of them are unknown...
is this thing bugged?

21:03.800 --> 21:04.026
(Dullahan, Lich, Immortal Sovereign)

21:04.026 --> 21:06.807
(Dullahan, Lich, Immortal Sovereign)
It has multiple races, all top-tier.

21:06.807 --> 21:10.770
Tanaka is absolutely nothing
compared to him...

21:10.770 --> 21:12.563
It's absolutely OP!

21:13.314 --> 21:15.691
A lich is strong in magic.

21:15.691 --> 21:18.444
I don't think I'd win in a ranged battle.

21:18.444 --> 21:20.863
Then I'll fight him in close combat!

21:27.670 --> 21:31.160
I don't care how OP you are,
there's no way you can stop this!

21:35.210 --> 21:37.050
You got to be kidding me...

21:38.756 --> 21:41.383
It moves at an unbelievable speed.

21:42.376 --> 21:45.012
But I can make use of that!

21:46.722 --> 21:48.140
Gambit!

21:50.059 --> 21:51.519
I'll hit you this time!

21:57.775 --> 21:59.527
I see...

22:04.326 --> 22:08.262
I'll definitely find a way
to win against your Hypersonic Speed!

22:17.795 --> 22:22.383
♪ The sunset I saw on my own was beautiful ♪

22:22.383 --> 22:27.596
♪ I ended the day
Without having anyone to talk about it ♪

22:27.596 --> 22:32.226
♪ I care not for the loneliness and moved on ♪

22:32.226 --> 22:37.398
♪ One thing after another
New stuff keeps appearing before me ♪

22:37.398 --> 22:42.027
♪ I went through so many things
Yet I can't imagine how it will go ♪

22:42.027 --> 22:44.697
♪ How silly I am ♪

22:44.697 --> 22:49.326
♪ They might look bland
Yet that's not always the case ♪

22:49.326 --> 22:54.331
♪ They toy with the careless me
Who still hasn't learned my lesson ♪

22:54.331 --> 22:59.044
♪ As always, we're all loners ♪

22:59.044 --> 23:03.966
♪ Each time we pass by
We say our hellos and goodbyes ♪

23:03.966 --> 23:08.846
♪ I care not
I simply want to play for today ♪

23:08.846 --> 23:13.976
♪ Having a little fun
Before saying good night ♪

23:16.645 --> 23:22.943
♪ I hum as I think of the next time
We meet again ♪

23:26.405 --> 23:32.703
♪ I hum on in the middle of
My lonely journey ♪
